  "details": "The most recent update got rid of the ability to change your mic settings in game... I guess my first question is... why? It just creates a Massive inconvenience to have to relaunch the game to change which mic your using. \n\nI have my phone set as a mic so I can play music for my friends in game, I also have fullbody tracking so I used to like dancing in VRC with my music. I’m now forced to either not do something I previously enjoyed doing (dancing to music in like the box or something) or I can set my mic to music... but then not be able to talk to people.\n\nPlease fix this... this seems like a pointless change that helps nobody.",
